DESCRIPTION:Dear all\,\n\nI understand that you've just finished the secon
 d assignment and want to take a breather.\n\nBut once again\, I'm trying m
 y best to keep our promise we made in the beginning of the semester.\n\nHe
 nce\, what I decided to do is to post the assignment as posted but extend 
 the deadline (i.e.\, Nov 22nd -> Nov 30th\, extended by more than a week).
  Hope this helps ease the burden for you guys (but less break before the f
 inal exam).\n\nBTW\, the final exam date has been set to be Dec. 15th.\n\n
 Without further ado\, here is your final assignment: [SOI1010_Machine_Lear
 ning_II___Assignment_3.pdf] (https://learning.hanyang.ac.kr/courses/212920
 /files/11974279?verifier=snMLaczl0KMiiwJaArefv8Qulp6rhLGNEbwg89VR&wrap=1)
